{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01591","headline":"琴曲歌辞 宛转歌二首 二 · 刘方平","name":"琴曲歌辞 宛转歌二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓将近，黄姑织女银河尽。\n九华锦衾无复情，千金宝镜谁能引。\n歌宛转，宛转伤别离。\n愿作杨与柳，同向玉窗垂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘方平","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01591.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01591","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}